# Keep source documentation and small provenance records visible in Git.
!data/raw/**/
!data/raw/**/README.md
!data/raw/**/archive_manifest.json
!data/raw/**/planned_predicate.json
!data/raw/**/download_metadata.json
!data/raw/**/doi.txt
*.zip
*DwcA
*DwC-A*

# Local/generated logs
*.log

# Large reference and logistics PDFs kept locally
docs/field-logistics/*.pdf
references/papers/*.pdf

# Large generated results remain available locally; regenerate from source data.
